[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the steering wheel in\nthe centred position with the wheels straight.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Closely observe the safety regulations\nestablished for this operation.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p><a href=\"#/2429452\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429214\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429576\">7040A26</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts.</p><p>2. Release retainer (2a) from the tab and move the Cruise Control\nlever assembly (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045085.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Cruise Control</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428418\">H7</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Recover the Cruise Control assembly lever.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045086.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the lever is undamaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection and position\nthe lever by engaging the retainer.</p><p>Tighten the bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429576\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429214\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429452\">5580C18</a></p><p>Check that the Cruise Control device works\nproperly.</p>"]]